# hair/adult/braid_hang: Braid's hanging part: over her left shoulder in front, over the near shoulder in side views; the tip swings (hair keys)
# (run fix i3, 2026-10-22) the side run's `run` key streams the braid back from the nape down her back (R and L), a
# strand 3 px wide ending in its tie: on the chest it read as a sash (L) or a badge (R).
# (run fix i1, 2026-10-22) its own key channel `braid` (the clips name braid= beside hair=) and a `run` key for the side
# run: on the leaned chest, the tip straight under the braid (no gap row), so it never floats off the sheared torso.
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body adult
role hair braid
layer neck
anchor head
keys braid
z 1

